| File | Change |
|------|--------|
| `src/Contracts/ReceivesPivotPayload.php` | New interface |
| `src/Traits/ExtendFireModelEventTrait.php` | Override `fireCustomModelEvent()`; build payload before custom-event dispatch |
| `tests/DispatchesEventsTest.php` | 3 new tests |
| `tests/Events/LegacyPivotAttached.php` | Test fixture — legacy class (no interface) |
| `tests/Events/PayloadAwarePivotAttached.php` | Test fixture — implements interface |
